Father John Thornton, played by Ciaran Flynn.

6
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:30,000
Mother Superior, played by Helena Bereen.

7
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:34,000
Kathleen O'Brien, played by Lauren Coe.

8
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:38,000
Sister Maria Louise, played by Carleen Melaugh.

9
00:45:36,000 --> 00:45:42,000
Eileen, played by Dearbhail Carr.

10
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:46,000
The Devil's Doorway is a 2018 found footage horror film directed by Aislinn
Clarke and co-written with Martin Brennan and Michael B.

11
00:55:44,000 --> 00:55:50,000
The film had its world premiere at the 44th Seattle
International Film Festival on 25 May 2018.

12
01:00:48,000 --> 01:00:54,000
IFC Midnight released the film in the United States on 13 July 2018.

13
01:05:52,000 --> 01:05:58,000
The film explores themes of nun, asylum, possession, priest, possessed.

14
01:10:56,000 --> 01:11:02,000
The tone is dark and emotional.
